tream OC → N downstream OC|Không trọng yếu|Có|**`NEW`**|\n|Event recalculation on Close|Chưa phải core|Critical|**`NEW`**|\n\nWorkshop cuối cùng cũng xác nhận phần lớn công thức/report có thể dùng lại từ Garment, thay đổi chủ yếu nằm ở process và threshold. Pasted text Pasted text\n\n---\n\n# 15. Data Flow hiện tại\n\n#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_603_{font-family:-apple-system-body,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Helvetica,\"Apple Color Emoji\",Arial,sans-serif,\"Segoe UI Emoji\",\"Segoe UI Symbol\";font-size:16px;fill:rgb(92, 106, 114);}@keyframes edge-animation-frame{from{stroke-dashoffset:0;}}@keyframes dash{to{stroke-dashoffset:0;}}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_603_ .edge-animation-slow{stroke-dasharray:9,5!important;stroke-dashoffset:900;animation:dash 50s linear infinite;stroke-linecap:round;}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_603_ .edge-animation-fast{stroke-dasharray:9,5!important;stroke-dashoffset:900;animation:dash 20s linear infinite;stroke-linecap:round;}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_603_ .error-icon{fill:rgba(253, 248, 233, 0.96);}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_603_ .error-text{fill:rgb(92, 106, 114);stroke:rgb(92, 106, 114);}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_603_ .edge-thickness-normal{stroke-width:1px;}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_603_ .edge-thickness-thick{stroke-width:3.5px;}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_603_ .edge-pattern-solid{stroke-dasharray:0;}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_603_ .edge-thickness-invisible{stroke-width:0;fill:none;}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_603_ .edge-pattern-dashed{stroke-dasharray:3;}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_603_ .edge-pattern-dotted{stroke-dasharray:2;}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_603_ .marker{fill:rgba(92, 106, 114, 0.494);stroke:rgba(92, 106, 114, 0.494);}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_603_ .marker.cross{stroke:rgba(92, 106, 114, 0.494);}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_603_ svg{font-family:-apple-system-body,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Helvetica,\"Apple Color Emoji\",Arial,sans-serif,\"Segoe UI Emoji\",\"Segoe UI Symbol\";font-size:16px;}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_603_ p{margin:0;}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_603_ .label{font-family:-appl